  <Section heading="About Matthew Cochran" description="Product and tech leader · Scale Readiness Validator">
    <div class="max-w-[65ch]">
    <p>Matthew Cochran is Co-Founder at OutboundLabs. He has over twenty-five years of experience across digital product development: strategic analysis, product and technical leadership, architecture, and operations.</p>
    <p>His work focuses on helping Series A SaaS companies validate scale readiness—across architecture and market focus—before they commit more headcount and budget.</p>

    <h3>Background</h3>
    <p>Previously Founder, CTO at TruthShield; former CTO at Artnet; senior leadership roles at Medidata, Shutterstock, and others.</p>

    <h3>Impact</h3>
    <p>He has led product and engineering teams through legacy modernization, cloud migration, and process and architecture improvements with measurable impact on velocity and deployment.</p>

